{{wikipedia}}
==English==

===Etymology===
Uncertain, but supposed to be from the [[Biblical]] story of [[Adam]] eating the forbidden fruit, an apple, and it imagined sticking in his throat.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[Adam]]'s [[apple]]}}

# {{anatomy}} The [[lump]] in the [[throat]], usually more [[noticeable]] in [[male]]s than in [[female]]s; the [[laryngeal prominence]].

